,000 bytes/sec \u2248 2 TB/s. If memory bus can move only 500 GB/s, it takes 4x longer to get data than to compute. Even if calculators idle, frame can't finish. Analogy: 10,000 chefs can chop in seconds, but only one narrow hallway to pantry; if ingredients arrive slowly, chefs wait. Engineers: increase bandwidth (wider bus", "top2": [[[1596, -0.0008431650348939002], [760, -7.881080627441406]], [[1144, -8.583106136939023e-06], [1902, -12.457993507385254]], [[4087, -0.4986897110939026], [310, -1.0200902223587036]], [[1156, -0.01916203461587429], [303, -4.114020347595215]], [[579, -0.11896181851625443], [25, -2.285892963409424]], [[1622, -0.001214824616909027], [3296, -6.891302108764648]], [[25, -0.3952431082725525], [13, -1.244478702545166]], [[10033, -0.3091415464878082], [79091, -1.7298816442489624]], [[310, -0.010172553360462189], [303, -4.616980075836182]], [[21520, -0.08235814422369003], [1496, -2.547327756881714]], [[1496, -0.006822261027991772], [32308, -4.994475841522217]], [[33541, -0.017265697941184044], [2812, -4.068230152130127]], [[5286, -8.333076402777806e-05], [261, -9.953539848327637]], [[11, -0.3894861340522766], [303, -1.7817763090133667]], [[883, -0.037746183574199677], [3835, -3.980987310409546]], [[220, -4.172333774477011e-06], [19, -12.64913558959961]], [[19, -2.014657366089523e-05], [20, -11.455052375793457]], [[15, -1.7047073924914002e-05], [18, -11.498119354248047]], [[15, -3.576279254957626e-07], [16, -15.263115882873535]], [[4105, -2.3841887468734058e-06], [3069, -13.339491844177246]], [[11, -0.0019595737103372812], [13, -6.281052589416504]], [[3069, -6.55653229841846e-06], [4779, -12.995566368103027]], [[21966, -0.29943224787712097], [13775, -1.3967070579528809]], [[6973, -0.6504011750221252], [628, -0.7651281356811523]], [[539, -1.180178969661938e-05], [4779, -11.354488372802734]], [[4779, -4.410753263073275e-06], [32288, -12.519551277160645]], [[32288, -1.3589951777248643e-05], [116532, -11.29726791381836]], [[4598, -0.11787630617618561